  "bodyText": "Home\nVisit Us\nExhibitions\nEvents\nOnline Talks\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nCollections\nBlog\nResearch\nLearning\nShop\nCart\nMy Account\nAbout\nBecome a Friend\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\n\n01993 810 210\n\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\n  \nHome\nEvents\nExhibitions\nCollections\nFriends’ Membership\nVisit\nShop\nBasket\nMy Account\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nResearch\nLearning\nOnline Talks\nBlog\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\nImage Services\nAbout\nBooks\nGifts\nWoodstock’s Last Night of the Proms | St Mary Magdalene Church | 7pm 26 September 2026\n£12.00\n\n100 available\nWoodstock's Last Night of the Proms | St Mary Magdalene Church | 7pm 26 September 2026 quantity\nAdd to Cart\n\nFeaturing the Waterloo Band & Bugles of The Rifles, this 'Last Night of the Proms'-style live concert kicks off from 7pm at Woodstock's St Mary Magdalene Church.\n\nProceeds from ticket sales support the St Mary Magdalene Church Roof Fund and Soldiers of Oxfordshire Trust.\n\n---\n\nThe Waterloo Band and Bugles of The Rifles is part of 7 RIFLES and rehearse in theirown purpose-built\nmodern band block on the same site as A Coy at Edward Brooks Baracks, Abingdon.\n\nThe Waterloo Band & Bugles is a flexible and versatile ensemble and have provided musical support for\na wide range of occassions, from their 35 piece concert band to marching bands and quintets for smaller venues both locally and around the world.\n\nDate: 26-September-2026\nTime: 19:00\n\nLocation: St Mary Magdalene Church, Park Street, Woodstock OX20 1SJ\nType: physical\n\nRelated products\nLee Miller: A Woman at War – An evening with Ami Bouhassane | 7pm, Thurs 3 September 2026\n£15.00 Add to cart\nMeet Me at the Soldiers Museum | 2pm – 4pm | Thursday 25 June 2026\n£0.00 Add to cart\nMeet Me at the Soldiers Museum | 2pm – 4pm | Thursday 18 June 2026\n£0.00 Add to cart\nPOSTPONED Kinder | Show Time: 1pm\n£6.00 Read more\n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Museum\nPark Street.\nWoodstock\nOxfordshire OX20 1SN\n\nPhone and Email:\nGeneral Enquiries & Event Tickets: 01993 810 211\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and conditions",
